              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ndaviti amwĩa Avisai, na athũkũmi make onthe, Sisyai, mwana wakwa, ũla waumie kĩnyunyunĩ kyakwa, nũnũũmantha thayũ wakwa: Mũmbenyamini ũũ atonya kwĩka ũu mbee veana ata? Ekanai nake, na ekai aumangane; nũndũ Yeova nũmwĩaĩe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
