          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩngĩ, naĩle kũthũkũma ũũ? Ndyaĩle kũthũkũma vala ve mwana wake? O tondũ nathũkũmie vala ve ĩthe waku, now’o ngethĩwa vala ũĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
