          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Aithoveli amwĩa Avisalomu, Lika kwa aka ngombo ma au, ala watiie masũvĩae nyũmba; na Isilaeli onthe makeew’a nũthĩthĩtwe mũno nĩ ĩthe waku: na ĩndĩ moko ma onthe ala me naku makeethĩwa na vinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
